@LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Health check
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Create a short link (201 Created)
# @name createLink
POST {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/fundamentals/minimal-apis"
}

### Get short link details (200 OK)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}
Accept: application/json

### Get access statistics (200 OK, zeroed before the first access)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}/stats
Accept: application/json

### Redirect to the original URL (302 Found) - records one access
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/r/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}

### Get access statistics again (totalClicks increases after each redirect)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}/stats
Accept: application/json

### Statistics for an unknown code (404 Not Found)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links/doesnotexist/stats
Accept: application/json

### Invalid URL (400 Bad Request)
POST {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "ftp://example.com/file.txt"
}

### Unknown code (404 Not Found)
GET {{LinkAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/links/doesnotexist
Accept: application/json
